X: 1
T: the Britains
P: Longways for as many as will
%R: jig
B: "The Dancing-Master: Containing Directions and Tunes for Dancing" printed by W. Pearson for John Walsh, London ca. 1709
S: 7: DMDfD http://digital.nls.uk/special-collections-of-printed-music/pageturner.cfm?id=89751228 p.215
Z: 2013 John Chambers <jc:trillian.mit.edu>
N: All the A notes are flatted, so the usual K:Cm signature would be better.
M: 6/4
L: 1/4
K: Cdor
